WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
[Game music and puzzle sound effects]
Bleedoku. Mix colours. Bring the village home.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
A cosy colour puzzle.
A colourful home screen introduces the game.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
Mix colours, then set off giant combos.
Pieces drop into the chamber and react.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Four in a row? PRISM bomb!
Matching pieces trigger a blast.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
100 clever levels. Glass, stone, ice and more.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Rescue 20 friends. Every fifth level brings one home.
A BOOM clears the board. Sol is back!

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Bring the whole village home.
Rescued friends fill the village collection.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.370
Bleedoku. Free on Google Play.
[Music ends]
